# Diabetes Prediction System
A Machine Learning-based Diabetes Prediction System developed to predict the likelihood of diabetes using patient health parameters. The project utilizes advanced data preprocessing techniques and ensemble machine learning algorithms to achieve high predictive performance.

## Project Overview
This system analyzes patient medical information such as glucose level, blood pressure, BMI, insulin level, age, and other health indicators to predict diabetes risk. The objective is to support early diagnosis and improve healthcare decision-making through data-driven insights.

## Key Features
- Diabetes Risk Prediction
- Context-aware AI diabetes education assistant
- Data Preprocessing and Feature Engineering
- Machine Learning Model Training and Evaluation
- Ensemble Learning Techniques
- High Accuracy Prediction System
- Scalable and User-Friendly Architecture

