## Model Performance
| Metric | Score |
|----------|----------|
| Accuracy | 97% |
| Recall | 92% |
| Precision | 95% |
| F1-Score | 93% |

The model was evaluated using standard machine learning evaluation metrics to ensure reliable and robust prediction performance.

